---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Public Sector AI tools catalogue
pagePath: /
---

{% from "govuk/components/button/macro.njk" import govukButton %}

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">{{ site.serviceName }}</h1>

    <p class="govuk-body-l">Use this catalogue to find AI-related tools being developed across the UK public sector.</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">Data is scraped from the public internet and provided by GDS. It may not be 100% accurate. Always verify by visiting the source URL for each tool.</p>

    {{ govukButton({
      text: "Start browsing",
      href: "/tools/",
      isStartButton: true
    }) }}

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Before you start</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">You can browse all tools by date added or A to Z, or filter by AI method, organisation, origin, status, or usecase.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">There are currently <b>{{ tools.meta.count }} tools</b> in this catalogue. <a class="govuk-link" href="/about/">Learn more.</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
